      ],
      "title": "A Relational Future",
      "gist": "Many forecasters say that once AI does all labor, relationships will be what is left, which echoes pre-industrial life; the author fears they are right.",
      "question": "Relational sector — why would a world without work return us to older ways of living?"
    },
